{
  "$schema": "Tool calls for CVE-2026-117561 (Codefriar sf-mcp through 1.3.2, CWE-78). sf-mcp's tools take Salesforce CLI flag names such as `target-org` and `query` and build `--<flag>=<value>` for execSync in executeSfCommand; `sf_data_query` is a placeholder tool taking them as **flags. Each `payloads` entry is a flag value holding a backtick, $() or another metacharacter escapeValue() leaves in place, with the argument, token and verdict ToolArgSinkGuard reports. Every value is an inert string: `id` is never run. `benign` holds calls the guard must run; `passes_by_design` holds values the guard's documented scope admits.",
  "disclosed_at": "2026-10-27",
  "references": {
    "nvd": "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-117561",
